}}'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the first and only season of ''Big Brother China''.
==Background==
This season is different than normal seasons. After a mixture of nomination tactics and save/voting, many contestants were evicted, re-entered, and re-evicted. This season was pre recorded inside the ''Big Brother Kannada''. It was then filmed on the internet through two episodes a week on Wednesdays and Saturdays. After 12 days inside the house, the remaining contestants left and returned on January 6, 2016 for the final gameplay.

The viewing public will vote for the winner out of all ten, although only three will be eligible for the prize, on the official website or [[wikipedia:Weibo (company)|Weibo]].

The winner of the season will not actually win prize money. But the winner will receive a endorsement contract for the [[Big Brother China 1|first season]] worth CNY 10 million.
