==Twists==
* '''The Basement:''' Directly below the Big Brother house a basement was built. Unlike the lavishly furnished main house, the basement was dirty, musty, and did not have a ready supply of food or water. Rylan and Frankie, the first two housemates to enter the house, were called to the Diary Room and told that the remaining housemates would come out it pairs, and they would have to send one member of the pair into the main house and one member into the Basement. To help with this decision, the two were allowed to watch each housemate's intro video. The two sent Tricia, Gillian, Lacey, and Claire into the main house and Paula, Ryan, Sam, and Razor into the Basement. Then, when given the choice of sending either themselves or Heidi & Spencer into the Basement, they chose Heidi & Spencer.

