==Twists==
*'''Head of House: '''Like the [[Big Brother 9 (UK)|preceding civilian season]], this season featured a twist where one housemate could become the Head of House. On Day 1, Terry became the first and only celebrity Head of House, after being the only housemate to not claim a bed. He received his own private bedroom in the house, was immune from the first eviction, served as a judge for the house tasks rather than participating in them, and had to choose the first three housemates to face eviction. Terry's role as Head of House ended after nominations on Day 5.
