|video=[[File:Celebrity Big Brother UK - Series 4 (2006) - Official Opening Titles|200px]]}}'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the fourth season of ''[[Big Brother UK (franchise)|Celebrity Big Brother]]''. It premiered on January 5, 2006, 5 months after the conclusion of ''[[Big Brother 6 (UK)]] ''and using the same house as that series. This season was notable for featuring the first non-celebrity to appear on ''Celebrity Big Brother'', 22 year-old Chantelle Houghton of Essex. Chantelle would go on to win this season.

Following the end of the series, Chantelle married singer and fellow housemate Preston in August 2006, although the couple were separated 9 months later. Both Chantelle and Preston would later return to participate in ''[[Ultimate Big Brother]]'', placing 3rd and 6th respectively.
==Twists==
* '''Non-Celebrity:''' Chantelle, the first housemate to enter the house, was not a celebrity. She was given a task by Big Brother to convince her fellow housemates that she was a member of the (fictional) girl band Kandy Floss. Failure to convince her fellow housemates would result in her being evicted from the house.

