'''Old Skool''' was an alliance on ''[[Big Brother 24 (US)]]''.

Initially dominating the first two evictions as they won the Head of Household competitions, Old Skool was quickly dismantled when their hapless interactions with the outsiders exposed their alliance and resulted in the formation of the new dominant alliance called [[The Leftovers]], with [[Ameerah Jones]] being their first victim. Effectively usurping control throughout the entire game, The Leftovers annihilated Old Skool, although several attempts to reform by the remnants of the latter alliance were done with little success. {{Clear}}
